        "retrieved": "2026-10-12",
        "revision": 1329347609,
        "heading": "Cultivation",
        "text": "The wonderberry shrub is an easy-to-grow plant which is grown similarly to tomatoes. Seeds are sown in the summer in full or part sun. Fruit can be expected in 75 days.",
